  "html": "<table>\n<tr>\n<td><div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:202px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Graves.jpg\" title=\"Gr'Aves\"><img alt=\"Gr'Aves\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"207\" src=\"/images/Graves.jpg\" width=\"200\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Graves.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Gr'Aves</div></div></div>\n</td><td><div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:202px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Chudd.jpg\" title=\"Chudd\"><img alt=\"Chudd\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"196\" src=\"/images/Chudd.jpg\" width=\"200\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Chudd.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Chudd</div></div></div>\n</td><td><div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Doyle.jpg\" title=\"D'Oyle and Pvvnly\"><img alt=\"D'Oyle and Pvvnly\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"183\" src=\"/images/Doyle.jpg\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Doyle.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>D'Oyle and Pvvnly</div></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table><br/>\n<p>These four Poison Orok Champions are found in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"The Mutanous Malaise\">Z'lash's Pad</a> off the <a href=\"/wiki/Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"Mutanous Malaise\">Mutanous Malaise</a>.  They are objects of the quest <a href=\"/wiki/Monster_Mosh\" title=\"Monster Mosh\">Monster Mosh</a>.  Although Gr'Aves and Chudd are sometimes found separately, D'Oyle and Pvvnly seem to be a team and are found together.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
